      "Solid PLA reference: E = 2.06 GPa, Poisson ratio = 0.35, density = 1.24 g/cm\u00b3. Includes the shelf\u2019s own weight.",
      "Contact mesh: 2 mm voxels; nominal surface contacts. Values are preliminary contact estimates, not a verified load rating.",
      "Small elastic movements only. Printed layers, infill, creep, wood bending, furniture joints and whole-table stability are not simulated."
